{
  "id": 8859736113351,
  "title": "Personalized Yggdrasil Vibrant Gold Quilt Sets, Machine Washable",
  "handle": "personalized-yggdrasil-vibrant-gold-quilt-sets-machine-washable",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolism of growth and connection with our Jeminise Personalized Tree of Life Quilt Set. This unique bedding set, featuring the Yggdrasil design, brings both comfort and meaningful artistry to your home, making it a perfect gift for loved ones or a cherished addition to your own space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Features an amazing Yggdrasil Tree of Life design, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in 5 sizes: Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional and decorative, suitable as a bedding set, a cozy wrap for reading or relaxing, or for indoor and outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal and practical gift for housewarmings, weddings, Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas Day, or for family members like moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandmas, grandpas, wives, husbands, sons, and daughters.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, can be air dried without heat; microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 Quilt, with an optional Pillowcase.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Yggdrasil in Vibrant Gold</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches), Twin(68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
